              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">When this model takes Damage in a Melee Exchange, all Friendly models gain a Shame Token.
If this model is Killed or Removed from Play, this Warband cannot score Scenario Points and models in this Warband may not perform Scenario Actions for the rest of the turn.
This model may have Equipment Attached that has Requirement [Fujitaka].

This model may only be recruited into any Warband recruiting the Passing the Night Theme.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
