            <profile name="Like Sand Through the Hourglass" id="7450-66d7-77c2-28ce" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">This model&apos;s Melee and Ki Boosts are variable (X). X is equal to the Activation Counters currently on this model to a minimum of one.
When using its Naginata, this model may secretly remove one dice from its Melee Pool to choose any number of its listed Special Abilities for this Melee Exchange, ignoring their usual cost. Resolve any Damage roll normally regardless of other Abilities declared.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Hunter of the Void" id="627a-1052-e22a-291c" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">When this model enters BtB with a Void Rift, the Active Player may place this model in BtB with any other Void Rift and continue its movement (if any) from there.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
